      },
      "body": "County Council Special Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-29",
      "text": "The mayor's office said that after Council approval of the sister city resolution, it would notify the city and plan a ceremonial acceptance.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
